senses
  entry
    definition "the number midway between the two middle numbers in a series containing an even or odd number of items"
    id oewn-06033170-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms ("median value")
  entry
    definition "relating to or constituting the middle value of an ordered set of values (or the average of the middle two in a set with an even number of values)"
    examples ("the median value of 17, 20, and 36 is 20" "the median income for the year was $15,000")
    id oewn-01599054-s
    partOfSpeech s
    synonyms (average)
  entry
    definition "dividing an animal into right and left halves"
    id oewn-00782692-s
    partOfSpeech s
    synonyms (medial)
  entry
    definition "relating to or situated in or extending toward the middle"
    id oewn-00331928-s
    partOfSpeech s
    synonyms (medial)
